abstract: "Reproducible computational workflow for a harmonized record-level household-income dataset from Brazilian PNAD and PNAD Continua surveys, including annual extraction metadata, deterministic trusted-layer treatment, technical validation, inequality statistics, Gompertz-Pareto analysis, and publication assets."
